格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"A comprehensive library of AI agent skills for academic research and writing, designed to be used by autonomous agents to generate high-quality research outputs.","id":"gh:1141061224","install_available":true,"language":"Python","name":"Paper-Agent-Skills","slug":"Scodive/Paper-Agent-Skills","topics":["agent-skills","dsh-plugin","dsh-skills"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"A comprehensive library of AI agent skills for academic research and writing, designed to be used by"},{"id":"p1s2","text":" autonomous agents to generate high-quality research outputs."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# Paper-Agent-Skills"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Evidence-aware research writing skills for AI agents. Revise a manuscript against supplied experimen"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"t records and references, with traceable suggestions, focused edits, and validation reports."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Includes **academic paper revision**, **rebuttal preparation**, and **presentation storyboarding**. "},{"id":"p4s2","text":"The host agent performs the review; bundled Python tools package the evidence and validate edits. Th"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"e tools require no model API key."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Available in the skills.sh directory."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Installation"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Python 3.10+ and Node.js are required for this installation path. Install all three skills into the "},{"id":"p7s2","text":"shared agent directory, which DSH can discover:"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Each skill includes its executable tools and readable runtime. A source checkout is not required aft"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"er installation. Other supported agents can be selected through the skills CLI."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"### As a DeepSeek Harness (dsh) plugin"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"The same three skills also ship as a DSH plugin bundle, which registers them as a bundled skill prov"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"ider in the model's skill catalog:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Either installation path works. The plugin bundle requires DSH 0.2.1 or newer and needs no build ste"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"ther installation path works. The plugin bundle requires DSH 0.2.1 or newer and needs no build step."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Usage"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Open an agent session in your working directory and provide:"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"> Use academic-paper-writing to revise paper.tex against results.csv and references.bib. Use .paper-"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"agent-venv/bin/python. Complete preparation, full-text review, edit application, and checks. Save th"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"e run to runs/review-01 and retain unresolved evidence gaps."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Read the outputs in `runs/review-01/results/`:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"- `suggestions.md` — recommendations and unresolved items.\n- `revised.md` or `revised.tex` — the rev"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"ised manuscript.\n- `changes.diff` — the exact edits.\n- `checks.md` — mechanical checks and evidence "},{"id":"p18s3","text":"ipt.\n- `changes.diff` — the exact edits.\n- `checks.md` — mechanical checks and evidence limitations."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Inputs: Markdown, single-file TeX, or text-based PDF; experiment records in JSON/CSV; references in "},{"id":"p19s2","text":"BibTeX/JSON. See input formats."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## Validation"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Observed results on the supplied synthetic fixture; engineering checks and live agent execution are "},{"id":"p21s2","text":"reported separately."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"| Evaluation | Observed result | Scope |"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"| Automated test suite | 40/40 passed | Ingestion, integrity, rejection rules, and standalone bundle"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"s |\n| Remote installation | 3/3 skills; 49 bundle files matched | Public GitHub source installed wit"},{"id":"p23s3","text":"h skills CLI |\n| GitHub Actions | 2/2 jobs passed | Python 3.10 and 3.13; run |\n| Invalid response s"},{"id":"p23s4","text":"cenarios | 9/9 rejected | Unknown evidence, unsupported numbers, stale edits, and related cases |\n| "},{"id":"p23s5","text":"Fixed-response replay | 5 → 0 mechanical findings; 2 pending items retained | Pre-authored response,"},{"id":"p23s6","text":" not a new model run |\n| Live DSH skill loading | 3/3 skills loaded | DSH 0.2.2-rc.1; skills install"},{"id":"p23s7","text":"ed by skills CLI 1.7.6 |\n| Live DSH paper revision | 5 → 0 mechanical findings; 6 edits; 3 pending i"},{"id":"p23s8","text":"tems retained | One independently generated synthetic-case response |"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"The live DSH process completed successfully and its artifacts passed an independent recheck. Rebutta"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"l and slide skills were loaded but did not receive end-to-end behavioral evaluation. These results *"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"*do not establish writing-quality gains, scientific correctness, or acceptance-rate improvements**."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Distribution results · Engineering results · DSH results · DSH-generated response · Methodology"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"For a local output preview: `python3 examples/revision/demo.py --out output/demo-01`. This replays a"},{"id":"p28s2","text":" pre-authored synthetic review. Source workflows and additional commands are documented in the detai"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"red synthetic review. Source workflows and additional commands are documented in the detailed guide."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"MIT License. Collected papers retain their original licenses. Experimental records are not reproduce"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"d, references are not independently verified, and PDF layout is not preserved by the tools."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
